WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.600
What's going on?!

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.610
<i>The year is 2016 AD.</i>

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.110
<i>The world of slightly
clumsy, cheeky, tomboyish,</i>

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.180
<i>panicky high school girl 
Asagaya Minoa is in crisis.</i>

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>A true madame and anime 
otaku, Kamiigusa Arisu.</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.800
<i>A studious glasses girl and 
anime otaku, Kouenji Miko.</i>

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.370
<i>Cosplayer and anime otaku, Aoyama Erika.</i>

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.760
<i>Evil-eyed man with special abilities, 
and anime otaku, Musashisakai Kai...</i>

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.090
<i>Her comrades were all consumed by anime.</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.430
<i>Her bittersweet but burning relationship</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>with cowardly traitor 
Nakano Aurora is concluded.</i>

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.520
<i>Aurora reveals many truths:</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.060
<i>That the anime world and real 
world exist in parallel;</i>

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:53.750
<i>that the anime club was the location 
of Japan's first anime studio;</i>

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.280
<i>and that Aurora himself was a 
resident of the anime world.</i>

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:59.280
<i>Minoa can be heard shouting far and wide.</i>

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.290
<i>"Aurora-senpai!"</i>

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.560
Did that revelation ever happen?

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:08.420
Did they just kill me?!

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.620
Would you please stop calling me Aurora?

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:15.420
And what do you mean by 
"cheeky, tomboyish, and panicky"?

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:20.210
<i>Minoa's protest against her character 
profile was shot down without mercy.</i>

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:22.930
You're going to ignore me?

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.530
<i>This man with the anime 
world beret is the man</i>

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.940
<i>who attempted to claim this 
program's setting as his own.</i>

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:34.330
<i>But to do so, he would have 
needed to be far more capable.</i>

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:38.400
<i>As a result, he was rejected 
by both anime and reality.</i>

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.700
<i>His very existence was erased.</i>

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:42.950
Death by narrator?

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:44.820
No!

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.410
What about our promise?

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.730
What did you promise?

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.100
My name...

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.960
That he would change my name.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:59.390
Maybe he's already fulfilled his promise.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:00.650
That's it.

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:02.200
That must be it.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.260
My name is...

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.260
Aurora.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.270
Son of a bitch!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:11.520
Where's the beret?

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:17.150
Neko-senpai, I still can't believe it.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:20.120
Isn't anime something that people make?

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.160
That's where you're mistaken.

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.240
<i>You</i> didn't create us.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.450
We've always existed.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:30.550
You only depicted us.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.270
I've watched it happen.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:38.750
Anime is created into this 
world, and is spread.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.180
It took decades.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.060
You're becoming anime, too.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.060
But first...

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.560
Do something about my damn name!

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:54.110
Aurora.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:57.850
Aurora.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.840
Stop!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:00.360
Quit harmonizing my name!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:01.060
Aurora.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:21.940
Minoa.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.070
What's wrong? You're so out of it.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:30.230
Have you watched yesterday's <i>Mahojuku</i>?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:32.980
The art was amazing.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:37.950
I wish I could have highlights like 
hers in my eyes in my close-up shots.

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.720
I want them to do my hair gradients, too.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.490
I totally agree.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:48.240
That studio really brings out the actors.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.310
Indeed.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.340
Thank goodness.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:51.480
We still have time to make changes.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.320
It must have been a dream.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.520
We do.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.320
Totally.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.170
Hey!

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.250
I'll write the script from here.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.250
It's time to start class!

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.170
Nice!

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:59.480
You there! Get back to your seats!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:56.970
Is that how it is?

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:58.500
I'll make it even better.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.800
Awesome!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.380
What?

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.640
What was that?

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.140
Are you serious?!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:15.990
It looks like the robotics club 
botched its new weapon again.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.340
Again?

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.360
What's the matter?

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.540
Minoacchi.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:33.830
What's wrong with you?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.030
You look like you've seen a ghost.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.540
Have you acquired a new element?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.820
Arisu-chan, call Sebas-san, please.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.090
Sebas?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:43.920
Why?

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.930
Just do it.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.810
It's a mask!

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:53.810
Half-assed.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.980
Mon petit coeur.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.340
I wasn't dreaming.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.000
I thought we had you.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.370
Minoa, why do you run?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.770
We used to be friends!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.210
We have a club meeting at lunch, Minoacchi.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:26.100
So, Dad, your recommendation for 
the season is <i>Yoyoyo</i> Season 2?

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.100
Onee-chan.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.510
Absolutely.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:31.860
<i>Your Reindeer in August</i> is 
my favorite returning series.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.830
That's not bad, either.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.890
I have high hopes for <i>Papipupepopip</i>, too.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:37.760
It's extended.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:38.650
No way!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.400
Hey, welcome home.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.420
Mom.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.420
I never knew Dad had the day off.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.530
You come home early when you 
don't have club work, huh?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.030
Yeah, and we only had morning classes.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.820
I had stuff.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.640
What's your favorite this season?

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:55.540
I can't wait for <i>A Sister's All You Need</i>.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.530
Miyako-chan's absolutely adorable.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.920
I know, totally!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.890
I've been interested in that one, too.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.640
I'm here, you know.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:17.690
Mom, can my friends stay over 
in the Japanese room upstairs?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.900
Can't you use your own room?

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.690
I'm having three over.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.690
Don't break Dad's figures.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:29.120
Let it eat you.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:38.870
<b>Death by Narrator</b>

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.250
Let it eat you!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.610
Just let anime eat you.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:49.840
Like everyone else.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:52.400
<i>Like everyone else?</i>

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:55.040
<i>That's right. Nothing will change.</i>

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.950
<i>The world won't disappear.</i>

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.440
<i>I won't become a zombie.</i>

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.350
You'll stop being lonely.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.860
This is how it should be, right?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.370
Why do you look so sad?

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.990
Hurry up.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.370
Become one with that girl.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.870
The door to the new world is almost open.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.240
Come to our side, Minoa.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.390
It was fun.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:42.190
I thought Arisu-chan and Miko-chan were 
unapproachable, but I got to talk to them.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.730
About anime.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.110
We decided to make the anime club together,

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:52.910
and we met Erika-senpai, 
Kaikai-senpai and Aurora-senpai.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.660
We always had anime to talk about.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:59.160
I don't want everyone to leave me.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.660
So let's just become anime.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.290
No.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.800
Ow...

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.500
Now you're getting it, Maya.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.600
I know.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.550
Want to join the next event as a family?

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:30.770
No way.

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:31.650
You're totally welcome to.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.400
No thanks.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:35.700
What is this?!

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.410
Got some time, little kitten?

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:40.910
Neko-senpai!

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.120
Mrowr.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:42.910
Meow.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.210
Now, are you ready?

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:45.920
Let's run.

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.670
Okay-nya!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.020
You've rejected becoming an anime.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.170
You're going to be rejected, now, too.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.490
Rejected?

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.680
You're not going to exist in this world.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:58.650
Is there no way to change 
things back to normal?

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.780
We just need the beret.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.180
What's the deal with that beret?

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:05.970
It's the source of great power,

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.190
connecting the anime world to the real world.

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.620
I found it!

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:17.200
I found it!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.450
At last, I'm...

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:24.340
We just need to bring the beret from the 
border between worlds back to the anime world.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.300
At least, that's my guess.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:27.330
Border?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:30.460
It's the door in the club room. What else?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.980
How did this happen in the first place?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:35.720
Long story short...

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Minoa's
world

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
What's inside
here?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Desire to open the door

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Border

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Woo! High-school girl's voice!
It's been a while!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Desire to get a look at
the high-school girl

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Coincidence!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Just a peek!!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Neko Excitement Gauge

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Anime world

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:36.720
It's like this.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.220
So it's all your fault!

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.180
I don't believe it.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.650
You know, though, this all happened

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:49.580
because you let Aurora get in your head,
and you opened the door.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:50.700
Jeez!

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.730
You're going to blame me?

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.430
Something's coming.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.540
The eyecatch...

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.160
No!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:14.000
<b>Anime-Gataris</b>

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:19.010
<b>Minoa, Katharsis</b>

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.970
That was terrible.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.000
I didn't expect the eyecatch.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.020
What is this?

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:27.880
The beret has begun purifying the world.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.520
It's all becoming a blank slate.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.990
A blank slate?

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.270
It's going to be erased.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:35.050
This is bad!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.860
It's all too late.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.530
I had a fun life.

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.910
Wait, wait, wait!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.940
Oy! Get a grip!

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.220
You're being consumed by a recap episode!

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.340
You're determined to take 
back your world, aren't you?

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:58.000
My world?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:02.860
The world that's vanishing now has 
in it your memories and your friends.

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:06.350
I won't let them erase my world!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.480
That's it!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.610
Your paw is so squishy.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.360
It gets me any she-cat, every time.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:22.870
Let's go.

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:24.690
Hurry!

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:25.740
It's catching up!

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.000
What the heck?!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.420
It's trying to remove impurities.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.250
Is there no one on my side?

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:37.250
Sure there are.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.670
Minoa.

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:46.390
You're from <i>Ultra Katharsis Koritsi</i>.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:48.090
No way!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:53.220
The robot's coming!

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:56.530
You have allies in the anime world.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:59.530
All the anime you've cherished.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.600
It's so stiff.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.380
Go, damn it!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.980
It's the real thing!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.800
Shoot, I'm getting nervous.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.510
I get the feeling, but pull the throttle.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.730
Right.

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.350
Go!

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.640
Go!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:32.920
Hear my song!

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:36.510
Get them!

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:40.130
Eternal Symphony!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.400
Damn, that's as far as we go.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.410
I'm going to ram through.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.420
My drill pierces the heavens!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:02.170
Go!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.800
Katharsis!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.100
We did it!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.940
Where am I?

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.300
What's going on?

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.370
Isn't this the climax?

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:24.040
We went against this world.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.200
We've been erased.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.940
No...

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:27.950
Mikene-chan!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.790
Aurora-senpai?

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.430
Mikene-chan!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.700
Mikene-chan!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.080
Mikene-chan, he's calling you.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.840
<i>You're</i> Mikene-chan.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.340
I'm Minoa.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
<b>Main characters</b>

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
"You're sorely mistaken
if you think twin tails
are all tsundere!"

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Kandaiji Saaya
Twin tail blonde princess-type.
Secretly an anime otaku,
but it's totally obvious. 
Takes the story in an
unimaginable direction.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Character Moe

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
"I watch lots of anime. 
I recently watched Gh**li!"

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Yotsugi Mikene
First-year high school student.
Has an anime otaku sister,
but is herself an anime newbie

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Protagonist

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
"This world in which I exist
is not the true world."

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Azusawa Najimi
 A seemingly bland girl
who actually has huge boobs.
Loves alternate world light novels.
Shuts herself inside her own world
with her obscure knowledge.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:48.340
Light Novel Type

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.400
This is bad,

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.610
we're back to the planning phase.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:48.340
That's a terrible name, even in planning!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.970
Nothing changes, even when I wear this.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:54.730
We can't make use of that.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.230
Wear it for me, Mikene-chan!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.480
It's Minoa.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.760
With this hat, one can do anything.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.150
It's a symbol of absolute status and power.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:07.990
No.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:11.990
The person who wore this 
never thought such a thing.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:15.840
This hat is a symbol of dreams, 
aspirations, and passion.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.750
It's the bridge between our 
world and the anime world.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:19.920
All right.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.380
So first, do something about my name!

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.130
This kid totally doesn't get it.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.440
Open the way to the border.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.150
Guys...

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.250
Come over here.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.760
We're all going to vanish 
if we don't do something.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.780
Anime won't disappear.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.780
You're just being stubborn, Minoa.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.540
Join our family so that 
we may live on together.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.040
Don't oppose anime.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.010
I love anime.

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:04.420
I absolutely love it now.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:09.170
I could see all kinds of things 
by talking about anime with you.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.570
And it made us friends.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.600
Arisu-chan, you invited me to the anime club.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:18.100
You opened the door to anime for me.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.520
That's where it all began.

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:24.940
Miko-chan, you never gave up, no matter 
how many times the scenario got scrapped.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.110
You showed me the passion and 
perseverance it takes to make anime.

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:32.840
Erika-senpai, you taught me how fun 
and amazing Akihabara and events are.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.310
You taught me to truly enjoy anime.

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:39.250
Kaikai-senpai, you saved the anime club

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.910
from its first crisis with 
your powerful speech.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.170
It's Kai.

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:46.300
I love anime.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:50.480
Anime brought me together with you.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.540
I <i>love</i> it.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:57.050
But in this anime, my favorite 
people are disappearing.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:59.560
I hate this piece of shit anime!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.980
Mi...no...a...

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.030
Wait!

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.490
Arisu...

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.140
It's over.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.830
My name...

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.830
Aurora-senpai!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.830
Don't call me that!

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:25.830
You helped me a lot.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:30.460
You always kept me from giving up.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.590
I admire you, Aurora-senpai.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:37.470
I won't give up.

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:50.590
No...

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.570
It's over?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.310
Arisu-chan.

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.800
Get a grip.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.390
Guys... Why?

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:15.380
There's still a lot of anime 
we need to talk about.

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.090
Arisu...

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.510
We haven't finished talking.

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:21.270
Especially after your passionate speech.

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:24.020
<i>I</i> wouldn't mind appreciating you.

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:25.910
We all appreciate you.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.870
Let's talk.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:30.270
A lot, lot, lot more.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:36.030
But we have to take this beret 
to the other side of the door.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.100
How do we do that?

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.040
You're kidding me!

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.550
RoboArisu?!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:57.300
It's answered my summoning and 
came from distant dimensions.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.770
The art's still shoddy.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.680
This is an exciting twist, don't you think?

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.930
Here we go, guys.

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:06.140
Alpha!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:06.890
Alpha!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:07.730
Alpha!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.480
Alpha!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.820
Not enough money.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:17.260
Oh, dear.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.440
Arisu-chan!

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:21.300
Don't try to solve everything with money.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.700
What else do we solve it with?

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:25.350
With our...

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.210
passion!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:37.630
The rocket punch is the highlight of anime!

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.480
The border's opened!

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.440
Neko-senpai.

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.530
I'm sick of chasing this damn hat!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:58.990
Aurora-senpai.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:01.950
I want to change that name.

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:06.950
But you said you admire me, Minoa-chan.

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:10.980
I don't want to become shit anime, either.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:15.840
We're taking this situation to 
our side along with this beret.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:18.220
But then...

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.210
Senpai!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.920
Later, Asagaya Minoa.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:26.470
Let's meet someday 
under happier circumstances.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.230
Aurora-senpai!

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:29.940
Auroracchi!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:30.980
Aurora!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:35.570
I told you, I don't like that name.

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.930
Oh, shit! My name!

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:38.360
Change my name!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.330
What?

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.220
Err...

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.370
G-G-G-Grovelboy!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.990
Grovel?!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:52.510
Senpai!

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:06.500
Have you still not chosen a club, Mii-chan?

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.930
Mm... not yet.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:12.280
I personally like <i>Hero School</i> 
and <i>Ru:ZERO</i> this season.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:15.000
I have big hopes for <i>Shikabari</i>, 
the original anime, too.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:18.000
The <i>Time Travel Shounen</i> OP is legit, too.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.570
Jun-nii's stylish fence jump!

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:22.700
You sure do like anime, Minoa.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:25.450
This season's kind of lopsided, too, honestly.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.580
You like anime?

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:33.430
Yeah.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.830
Actually, I love it.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.710
I do, too.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.090
Really?

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:41.090
I absolutely love Director Ogikubo.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.610
You totally get it, Arisu-chan.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.340
What's all this fuss about?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:47.600
Sorry, we got carried away.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:52.100
If you want to talk about anime so much, 
why don't you join the Anime Club?

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.600
Anime Club?

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.360
The president's a bit weird, though.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.760
Our Anime Club is good.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:02.890
Wait, President!

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:04.110
Pardon us.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.240
Here we are.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.780
Pardon me.

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:12.500
Miko-chan.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.750
I knew you'd come.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.250
So you did like anime.

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:18.470
Are you looking to join?

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.770
Welcome to the Anime Club.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:23.880
Mikocchi, can you redo this script? Thanks.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.260
More changes?

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.480
I'm looking forward to it, Chan-miko.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:30.890
Is that a character for 
the school festival anime?

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:32.400
Something like that.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:36.400
He's a singing, dancing, idol-lover 
with special abilities.

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.650
What's over there?

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:43.650
Why don't you open it?

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:50.740
Look!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:53.220
It's a mountain of treasures!

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:02.270
<b>Aurora (Kouki)</b>

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:33.010
<b>The End</b>

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:34.440
What?

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:36.020
Are we seriously doing this?

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:38.610
Who does this after the heartwarming finale?!

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:40.550
After <i>that</i> ending?!

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.050
Oh, whatever.

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:44.200
Merry Christmas, everyone!

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:47.950
And next week, happy New Year.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>Thanks for watching</b>

00:23:47.950 --> 00:23:49.520
Meow.
